    "innovation": "This paper presents a methodological refinement of the Czech national greenhouse gas inventory by incorporating dynamic, high-resolution climate zonation and district-level fertilizer data, which significantly improves the accuracy and reduces the reported nitrous oxide emissions from agriculture.",
